     Install into ~/Library/LaunchAgents on the Mac mini, see finance/bexio/README.md ("The hourly sync").
     Mon-Fri 08:00-18:00, on the hour (the window Benchi decided, 2026-10-14); nothing runs at the
     weekend or overnight. The wrapper runs the code that has landed (the main checkout), as the
     bexio-login agent above does. No secret here: the export launcher is the blessed script whose
     av line injects the vault tokens; /usr/local/bin/av must be the Verified Launcher of the blessed
     read script in the vault app, or the run stops at a vault prompt and mails (IT, 2026-10-14).
